WEBVTT

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.680
Who's <i>that</i>?

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:16.010
An army, here from Xianyang.

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:18.720
Why are they rounding everyone up?

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:21.810
Do they mean to scold us
for planning to surrender?

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:23.940
What else could we do?

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:29.860
Zui can't fight 30,000 enemy troops
with almost none of its own.

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:32.610
Are you sure about this, Zheng?

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:36.320
I mean, they were ready to give
themselves up to the enemy.

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:37.320
Right.

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:40.620
You try forcin' people
like that into fightin'

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:43.370
and you could be lookin'
at a riot instead!

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:45.710
Mother...

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:46.880
I'm scared...

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:51.460
There's nothing but women,
children, and old men

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:53.670
here in Zui anymore.

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:55.840
What would you have us do?

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:57.140
Yeah! That's right!

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:59.720
What can the Xianyang army do now?

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:01.720
Silence!

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:04.140
My name is Lord Changwen.

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:08.100
Lord Changwen--Qin's Minister of the Left!

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:10.150
Mi-Minister?!

00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:13.440
What brings a court minister to Zui?

00:01:14.650 --> 00:01:18.240
And this personage here

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:22.950
is the ruler of our kingdom,
the 31st King of Qin:

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:25.040
His Highness Ying Zheng!

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:24.030
"Zheng Speaks"
His Highness, here--for our sake!

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:26.330
We are unworthy!

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:29.410
We have done such a foolish thing...

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:33.080
To have forgotten Zui's role
as the throat of Xianyang

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:36.290
and instead surrender to the foe...

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:39.920
Such stupidity...
Forgive us, I beg of you!

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:41.680
Forgive us, Your Highness...

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:47.430
That's all it took--
just findin' out he's King?

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:49.390
Well, yeah.

00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:52.980
The King you'd probably
never see in your entire life,

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:55.560
going out of his way to visit--

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:57.980
and under these circumstances, too.

00:03:57.980 --> 00:03:59.190
Uh-huh...

00:03:59.190 --> 00:04:01.530
They were scared.

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:04.160
No army, enemy troops approaching...

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:06.870
The decision to surrender
was an agonizing one.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:12.870
We're off to a good start.

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:17.130
But the real work begins now, Sire.

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:23.550
I am Ying Zheng, King of Qin.

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:28.050
His Highness speaks!

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:31.520
So this is the voice of our king...

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:33.230
Listen closely,

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:34.730
people of Zui.

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:39.650
As you know, we are now
at war at Hangu Pass,

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:43.400
with a coalition army of
some 500,000 troops.

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:47.450
Hangu Pass still stands, thanks to
our soldiers' heroic efforts.

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:54.500
However, a detached enemy unit
of 30,000 took to the southern road

00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:58.710
and is now closing in on Zui,
the very throat of Xianyang.

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:07.140
Leading this army are two of Zhao's
Three Greats: Li Mu and Pang Nuan.

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:09.430
And...

00:05:09.430 --> 00:05:12.810
Xianyang is not prepared
to fight them off.

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:16.640
Not prepared?! What--

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:19.150
Will you just <i>listen</i>?

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:24.740
In other words, Zui is the last castle
capable of stopping the enemy army.

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:27.530
I'll say it once more:

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:29.450
If we do not stop the enemy here...

00:05:31.530 --> 00:05:33.540
...the Kingdom of Qin will perish!

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:41.750
B-But, Sire...

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:44.670
What troops we have are so few in number!

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:46.090
Hey!

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:47.630
I am aware.

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:50.260
But we <i>must </i>stop them--

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:51.600
here, in Zui.

00:05:54.810 --> 00:05:57.350
So... so he's saying...

00:05:57.350 --> 00:05:59.770
...<i>we </i>must fight...

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:01.520
...to fend them off.

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:05.190
It is frightening, I know.

00:06:05.190 --> 00:06:10.570
The enemy is robust, while you have
many old men, women, and children.

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:13.080
Much blood will be shed,

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:15.540
and many will lose their lives.

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:18.830
The hell is he tryin' to scare 'em for?!

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:21.000
He's trying to <i>inspire </i>them.

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:24.500
You can't <i>force </i>them to become soldiers!

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:25.760
However...

00:06:25.760 --> 00:06:29.430
Your fathers--and your fathers' fathers--

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:32.300
shed their blood and lost
their lives in the same way

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:34.260
to create the Qin we know today.

00:06:35.970 --> 00:06:39.560
Your very lives are built
upon their efforts.

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:42.310
If you surrender--if we lose--

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:44.650
all that will be for naught,

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:47.900
and Qin's history will end here.

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:50.320
Many of its people will be slaughtered;

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:53.200
the survivors, their land
seized from them,

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:56.660
reduced to being slaves
for another kingdom--

00:06:56.660 --> 00:07:01.330
your children, and your
children's children.

00:07:01.330 --> 00:07:04.420
<i>You </i>are the only ones who can stop it.

00:07:06.210 --> 00:07:08.170
I'll do it! I'll fight!

00:07:09.510 --> 00:07:12.300
D-Don't be rude! Sit down, Qiu!

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:13.800
Hey, Gan Qiu!

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:14.800
It's all right.

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:19.810
What is your name, my brave young man?

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:25.440
Gan Qiu, son of Gan Ren!

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:28.030
My pa's fighting at Hangu Pass!

00:07:28.030 --> 00:07:31.950
He told me to keep our family safe!

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:37.990
No way am I gonna let my ma and baby
sis be some enemy kingdom's slaves!

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:39.000
Qiu...

00:07:45.130 --> 00:07:47.800
Gan Qiu, son of Gan Ren.

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:51.720
I am proud to be able to fight beside
you on this crucial battleground.

00:07:56.890 --> 00:08:00.560
Did he say... "fight <i>beside </i>you"?

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:04.810
Will the king be fighting here, too?

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:09.400
Your Highness, you mustn't!
Please, return to Xianyang!

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:11.240
You must return--and quickly!

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:12.740
Your Highness!

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:14.660
I will <i>not</i>!

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:17.240
I have come to shed blood alongside you

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:19.950
on a battlefield that holds
Qin's fate in its hands.

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:25.580
Wu Yin, son of Wu Meng!

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:28.000
I'll fight by your side, Your Highness!

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:31.210
Yue Ming's son Yue Guang will fight, too!

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:35.470
I'm not feeble enough to be
counted among the elderly yet!

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:37.800
Your Highness! I am Xi Qu!

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:42.430
I lost my arm in battle last year,
but I've still got fight in me!

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:44.560
Huang Chun, daughter of Huan Bang!

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:47.480
Yes, I'm a woman, but I can fire arrows!

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:49.150
Here we go.

00:08:49.150 --> 00:08:50.480
I am Wan Ding!

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:54.150
I'll give this fight everything
I have, Your Highness!

00:08:54.150 --> 00:08:55.410
I'll fight, too!

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:57.200
So will Yang Shi!

00:08:57.200 --> 00:09:00.160
Please let me fight, too, Your Highness!

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:02.000
--And me!
--Us, too!

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:03.200
Your Highness!

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:06.370
C'mon!

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:07.210
Stand up!

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:09.630
Everyone, on your feet!

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:12.510
Zui will fight!

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:14.510
<i>There </i>it is!

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:20.350
Are you ready, heart and soul?

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:29.110
Qin and its 530 years of history
are riding on this battle!

00:09:29.110 --> 00:09:31.150
You have your ancestors'
divine protection!

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:36.360
And those who have lost their lives

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:38.870
most assuredly stand at our backs!

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:42.990
We will fight to the very end!

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:45.250
Children of Qin!

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:48.540
We <i>will </i>defend our kingdom!

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:55.670
I-I've got chills...

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:59.430
Amazing! Oh, Xin--that was amazing!

00:09:59.430 --> 00:10:00.720
Yeah!

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:03.600
Firin' up everyone like that
with just one speech?

00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:05.980
That's great-general-level stuff.

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:09.810
And he ain't even talkin' to soldiers!

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:13.980
You really are one hell of a King,

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:14.820
Zheng!

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:22.780
I knew it.
I knew my intuition was correct.

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:29.210
This man <i>will </i>surpass King Zhao,
god of the battlefield--

00:10:29.210 --> 00:10:30.540
I'm sure of it!

00:10:32.630 --> 00:10:35.840
Are you seeing this, Wang Yi?

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:48.440
"Zhao"

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:48.440
"The Southern Road: The Li Mu Army"

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:52.060
"Zui Castle"

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:52.060
Faster! The enemy's almost here!

00:10:52.060 --> 00:10:52.980
Next!

00:10:52.980 --> 00:10:53.940
Sir!

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:55.030
Next!

00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:56.190
Sir!

00:10:56.190 --> 00:10:57.530
To your posts!

00:10:58.700 --> 00:11:00.110
Get the water ready!

00:11:00.110 --> 00:11:01.070
Sir!

00:11:01.070 --> 00:11:02.530
And light the fires, too!

00:11:05.990 --> 00:11:08.960
Dammit. It's hopeless!

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:10.620
What's up, Diao?

00:11:10.620 --> 00:11:13.630
We may have the troops now,

00:11:13.630 --> 00:11:17.670
but we don't have enough
commanders for the four castle walls.

00:11:17.670 --> 00:11:20.470
I was counting on the army
left behind in Zui,

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:22.510
but they didn't have any
proven commanders.

00:11:24.390 --> 00:11:29.770
There's just four of us:
me, Xin, Lord Changwen, and Bi.

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:33.150
But I should be in the control center
so I can see the big picture

00:11:33.150 --> 00:11:35.610
and send in more troops.

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:38.320
That leaves three of us.

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:40.490
And that means one wall is open.

00:11:40.490 --> 00:11:41.950
What?!

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:43.410
I'll do it.

00:11:43.410 --> 00:11:45.830
No--that's risky, too.

00:11:45.830 --> 00:11:48.240
Once it begins, morale alone
won't do the trick.

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:51.370
We need a commander's knowledge out there.

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:54.960
Besides, if anything
happened to you, Zheng,

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:58.000
we wouldn't be able to go on fighting.

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:02.430
It ain't like we can do
anything about it <i>now</i>.

00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:04.430
The enemy's right around the corner!

00:12:04.430 --> 00:12:06.930
We're just gonna have to make
it work with what we got!

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:14.730
I guess I'll have to take that last wall.

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:18.480
But this is Li Mu we're up against!

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:23.030
He'll hit us on all four sides
and try to open a hole.

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:27.450
When he does, we'll need more
troops and a precise response,

00:12:27.450 --> 00:12:29.120
or we won't last half a day.

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:34.620
The cavalry! The cavalry's approaching!

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:36.290
So they're here.

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:38.380
No, wait--

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:41.300
that voice came from the northern gate.

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:42.170
Huh?

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:43.630
You mean--

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:45.220
Yes:

00:12:45.220 --> 00:12:46.680
from the direction of Xianyang.

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:03.320
"Qin Army Tactician" "Jie Yi"

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:03.320
High Commander Lord Changping's aide,
Jie Yi, with a hundred troops.

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:09.160
We have hastened here as
reinforcements on my master's orders.

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:12.450
Reinforcements--from Lord Changping?

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:18.000
There aren't many troops,
but about half are commander-tier.

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:22.840
My master says you are
to distribute them as you please.

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:24.510
My goodness!

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:26.340
Lord Changping...

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:28.010
Yes!

00:13:28.010 --> 00:13:29.890
Jie Yi, sir!

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:33.180
Ah, if it isn't Diao! It's been a while.

00:13:33.180 --> 00:13:34.890
You know him, Diao?

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:38.060
He was a lecturer at tactician school!

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:41.150
We've got some amazing
people here! Wonderful!

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:45.200
Incidentally...

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:46.700
We're here, too.

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:47.700
Oh!

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:48.820
Meng Yi!

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:51.370
And Jiang Ya--and Jin Liang!

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:55.790
You came... right into
the jaws of death...

00:13:55.790 --> 00:14:00.000
I was surprised, too, seeing this
would be my first campaign.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.710
Meng Yi just dragged us along.

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:07.970
Thank you... thank you so much...

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:09.090
He Liao Diao...

00:14:10.470 --> 00:14:12.470
Don't cry, He Liao Diao.

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:16.180
Save your tears for when
we've won this battle--

00:14:16.180 --> 00:14:20.230
and for when you know a man's touch.

00:14:20.230 --> 00:14:22.360
Watch out for that Meng Yi.

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:24.400
What are you talking about, sir?!

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:26.650
This is no time to be joking around!

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:31.070
We got ourselves a bunch of oddballs, eh?

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:32.620
That's everyone.

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:33.830
Yes, Sire.

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:35.200
Take your positions!

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:36.200
Sire!

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:40.080
"Qin"

00:14:48.760 --> 00:14:51.220
"West Wall"
"Lord Changwen"

00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:54.220
"East Wall"
"Bi"

00:14:54.760 --> 00:14:57.230
"North Wall"
"Jie Yi"

00:14:57.730 --> 00:14:59.730
"South Wall"
"Qin Army HQ"

00:15:00.310 --> 00:15:02.730
Looks like we made it.

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:04.690
Don't you need to be in position?

00:15:04.690 --> 00:15:07.030
It's right down there. I got time.

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:10.410
You stayin' here?

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:11.700
No.

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:16.450
I'll be giving rallying all four sides
shortly after the fighting begins.

00:15:19.710 --> 00:15:22.790
It's been four years since
we last fought together.

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:23.790
Yes.

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:27.460
We share a mysterious bond:

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:29.880
when I'm in trouble, you're there.

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:31.510
So am I!

00:15:31.510 --> 00:15:33.760
Right--you too, Diao.

00:15:37.310 --> 00:15:40.810
Y'know, things were real
touch-and-go four years back--

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:42.560
and they ain't much better now.

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:48.070
Are your preparations complete?

00:15:48.070 --> 00:15:49.070
Yeah.

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:51.030
'Course they are!

00:15:55.740 --> 00:16:00.540
Man, I got a <i>ton </i>of stuff
I wanna tell you, Zheng.

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:03.580
Let's you and me drink tonight, eh?

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:07.210
Booze tastes mighty fine on war nights!

00:16:07.210 --> 00:16:10.920
If you can live long enough
to drink it, that is.

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:14.890
In some ways, the first day
is the most dangerous.

00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:17.220
Oh, we're drinkin', all right.

00:16:17.220 --> 00:16:20.640
No way am I lettin' this castle fall!

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:37.370
That's them! They're here!

00:16:52.170 --> 00:16:56.890
Strange. My intel indicated that
Qin had very few troops at Zui.

00:16:56.890 --> 00:16:58.220
Indeed.

00:16:58.220 --> 00:17:02.640
Perhaps they brought in
troops from Xianyang.

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:04.390
That, or...

00:17:04.390 --> 00:17:07.060
...they armed the civilians.

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:11.820
We-We're totally surrounded...

00:17:11.820 --> 00:17:14.400
There's nowhere for us to run!

00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:15.700
Yeah...

00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:19.160
Y-You idiots! Who needs a place to run?

00:17:19.160 --> 00:17:24.210
Either we win and survive
or lose and die--that's it!

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:28.920
We-We've just gotta do it! Let's <i>do </i>this!

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:30.170
The latter, then.

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:34.340
Here comes a single horseman!

00:17:37.680 --> 00:17:39.600
Li Mu.

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:40.850
Li Mu...

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:47.940
I am Li Mu, one of Zhao's Three Greats!

00:17:47.940 --> 00:17:49.440
L-Li Mu!

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:52.530
That's Li Mu--of the Three Greats!

00:17:52.530 --> 00:17:55.070
A message for the residents of Zui:

00:17:55.070 --> 00:18:01.870
Though I am an enemy, I admire your
courage to take up arms as civilians!

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:03.750
Saw right through us...

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:08.460
But if you think you can wage war
on brute courage alone,

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:11.420
you are <i>gravely </i>mistaken!

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:14.130
Whereas <i>you </i>know nothing of battle,

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:17.590
<i>We </i>have an army of elite troops,
specially selected

00:18:17.590 --> 00:18:21.100
from each member of the coalition army!

00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:23.970
Elites from each coalition member?

00:18:23.970 --> 00:18:25.060
But that's...

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:29.270
"Zhao Army Brigade Commander" "Fu Di"

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:29.270
Yeah, but that squad
didn't get here in time.

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:32.860
No, they'll be coming down the
southern road right about now.

00:18:32.860 --> 00:18:36.400
They'll join us in two or three days.

00:18:36.400 --> 00:18:38.950
Sure--in two or three days.

00:18:38.950 --> 00:18:41.990
What's more, the commander of this army

00:18:41.990 --> 00:18:43.790
is another of the Three Greats

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:47.080
who slayed Wang Yi of your
Six Greats three years back

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:50.250
and recently slayed Lord Biao
on the southern road:

00:18:50.250 --> 00:18:51.580
Pang Nuan!

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:53.380
--Pang Nuan...
--Pang Nuan!

00:18:53.380 --> 00:18:56.510
I, Li Mu, am responsible for strategy!

00:18:56.510 --> 00:18:59.340
You don't stand the slightest
chance of winning!

00:18:59.340 --> 00:19:03.850
Do not give your lives in vain
for a battle that cannot be won!

00:19:03.850 --> 00:19:06.560
Surrender, Zui!

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:11.400
Surrender and I, Li Mu,
will not kill a single one of you!

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:14.730
Not a single one of us?

00:19:14.730 --> 00:19:16.280
Hey, what's all this?

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:22.070
Whoa, whoa--is it over already?

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:24.330
He won't... kill us...

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:28.370
Th-This is really bad, Xin.

00:19:28.370 --> 00:19:29.750
It's all right, Yuan.

00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:35.340
That fire he lit under 'em
ain't goin' out so easy.

00:19:40.970 --> 00:19:43.680
Like <i>hell </i>we're going to surrender!

00:19:45.260 --> 00:19:46.310
Toldja.

00:19:46.310 --> 00:19:47.640
Xin!

00:19:47.640 --> 00:19:51.100
They're just a tad nervous--
it's their first campaign.

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:54.310
All they need is a little
push from behind.

00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:58.230
Quit your yammerin', Li Mu!

00:19:59.490 --> 00:20:03.780
No one's takin' your bullshit bait!

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:09.040
Beggin' us to please, please
surrender--before we've even started!

00:20:09.040 --> 00:20:12.750
You're downright <i>scared </i>of us!

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:15.670
Bet your "elite forces" are
gonna love hearin' that!

00:20:17.130 --> 00:20:18.550
Xin.

00:20:18.550 --> 00:20:24.010
Too bad your little shake-up
routine won't work on us!

00:20:24.010 --> 00:20:25.800
And <i>that's </i>because

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:29.470
the people of Zui have a reason to fight--

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:31.230
even if it costs 'em their lives!

00:20:32.940 --> 00:20:35.230
Now get climbin' already, damn you!

00:20:35.230 --> 00:20:41.530
Zui ain't about to fall to the likes of
you, no matter <i>what </i>happens!

00:20:46.700 --> 00:20:48.790
Wh-Who <i>is </i>that?

00:20:48.790 --> 00:20:50.660
What high morale!

00:20:53.710 --> 00:20:59.000
How on earth can civilians
have so much fighting spirit?

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:01.130
Xin of the Fei Xin Force...

00:21:01.130 --> 00:21:04.430
No--he's not that powerful yet.

00:21:05.930 --> 00:21:09.720
Was there still a great-general-caliber
leader left in Xianyang?

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:16.810
"Zhao Adjutant" "Jin Chengchang"

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:16.810
I guess we'll just have to fight.

00:21:16.810 --> 00:21:19.110
We have no choice.

00:21:19.110 --> 00:21:23.320
This is our last great undertaking
before Xianyang.

00:21:23.320 --> 00:21:26.280
Onward! Archers, forward march!

00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:27.370
March!

00:21:28.870 --> 00:21:32.370
I can't bear going up
against civilians, though.

00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:35.790
That's on them.

00:21:35.790 --> 00:21:39.170
The people of Qin are such idiots.

00:21:39.170 --> 00:21:44.760
May Zui go down in history
as the Castle of Tragedy.

00:21:47.220 --> 00:21:49.510
They're in range, He Liao Diao!

00:21:49.510 --> 00:21:51.560
I know!

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:52.680
Fire!

00:21:53.850 --> 00:21:55.350
Return fire!

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:56.940
Run!

00:21:56.940 --> 00:21:58.270
Here they come!

00:22:09.910 --> 00:22:12.240
Dammit... damn it all!

00:22:12.240 --> 00:22:13.370
Stay strong!

00:22:15.620 --> 00:22:17.920
Don't bow down to fear!

00:22:17.920 --> 00:22:20.540
This is war! Stand and fight!

00:22:20.540 --> 00:22:21.670
<i>This</i>...

00:22:21.670 --> 00:22:23.840
...is what it means to
defend your kingdom!

00:22:27.970 --> 00:22:30.680
We managed to return their fire!

00:22:30.680 --> 00:22:32.260
Excellent!

00:22:37.980 --> 00:22:39.690
Pull!

00:22:43.690 --> 00:22:45.150
A ladder!

00:22:46.280 --> 00:22:50.160
No! They've already made
themselves a foothold!

00:22:52.280 --> 00:22:53.620
Another ladder over here!

00:22:53.620 --> 00:22:55.330
H-He Liao Diao!

00:22:55.330 --> 00:22:56.710
Quiet!

00:22:56.710 --> 00:23:01.420
These walls aren't high.
We expected their ladders to reach.

00:23:01.420 --> 00:23:04.880
We fight on the castle walls.
It all starts now!

00:23:04.880 --> 00:23:06.590
Y-Yeah, but...

00:23:06.590 --> 00:23:09.300
The civilian soldiers
are getting slaughtered!

00:23:09.300 --> 00:23:10.590
Go!

00:24:54.320 --> 00:24:57.990
Next on <i>Kingdom</i>: "The First Night."
